      "content": "HIGH STREET 1. 5252                                                   (East Side)                                                   No 27 TL 0507 1/151 II                       GV 2 Early C19.  Stucco.  Hipped Welsh slated roof with modillioned cornice.  3 storeys, rusticated quoins.  Early C20 shop front.  1st floor has canted bay sash window. 2nd floor has 2 sash windows with glazing bars in architrave surrounds with consoles to sills.  Included for group value. Nos 25, 27 and 29 form a group. Listing NGR: TL0558707769"
    }
